  "story": {
    "day": 125,
    "title": "Kaya's Volunteer Day",
    "sentences": [
      "Yesterday, Kaya got ready for volunteer work and took her own bag out.",
      "She carried a soft Brown Bear from the department store.",
      "The public bus went far away to the country.",
      "It stopped at the Sunshine Nursing Home.",
      "Kaya had half an hour to join the team.",
      "She acted as an interviewer for a memory tour.",
      "Kaya asked about a wolf story; a lady said \"Yes.\"",
      "She helped the twelfth and fourteenth residents hold small crafts.",
      "Kaya saw a toy plane and a poster to skate.",
      "\"Don't forget to drop off these shorts!\" someone told her.",
      "Soon, Kaya finished her work and looked for her bus.",
      "Finally, they had a warm roast lunch and didn't lose anything else."
    ]
  }
}